---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Countdown from '../components/Countdown.astro';
import { hotels, mapsUrl, zones } from '../data/hotels';
import { VENUE_MAP_URL } from '../data/venue';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');

const gcal = 'https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE'
  + '&dates=20270313T120000Z/20270314T000000Z'
  + '&text=' + encodeURIComponent('Boda de Ana & Emi')
  + '&details=' + encodeURIComponent('Nos casamos y queremos celebrarlo con vosotros.')
  + '&location=' + encodeURIComponent('Finca Los Azahares, Jerez de la Frontera');
---
<Layout title="Ana & Emi — Save the Date">
  <main class="std">
    <div class="std-img std-img--left">
      <img src={`${base}murallas-acuarela.png`} alt="Las Murallas Reales de Ceuta" />
    </div>

    <div class="std-head">
      <p class="std-eyebrow">Save the Date</p>
      <div class="std-ornament">✦</div>

      <h1 class="std-names">
        <span class="std-name-pair">
          <img src={`${base}icon-bellota.png`} class="std-icon" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
          Ana
        </span>
        <em>&amp;</em>
        <span class="std-name-pair">
          Emi
          <img src={`${base}icon-dedal.png`} class="std-icon std-icon--flip" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
        </span>
      </h1>

      <div class="std-rule"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="std-img std-img--right">
      <img src={`${base}puerto-acuarela2.png`} alt="Puerto de Ceuta" />
    </div>

    <div class="std-body">
      <p class="std-date">Sábado, 13 de Marzo de 2027</p>
      <p class="std-time">De 13:00 a 01:00</p>
      <div class="std-location">
        <a class="std-location-venue" href={VENUE_MAP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7z"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/>
          </svg>
          Finca Los Azahares
        </a>
        <span class="std-location-city">Jerez de la Frontera</span>
      </div>

      <div class="std-invite">
        <p class="std-invite-lead">
          Después de 13 años, a lo mejor es un poco precipitado, pero nos
          casamos.
        </p>
        <p class="std-invite-aside">
          (Nos hemos pegado unas vacaciones relax de la boda, pero ya nos hemos
          puesto a tope con la organización.)
        </p>
        <p>
          Si has recibido este mensaje de nuestra parte, es que esta boda
          tendría mucha menos gracia sin ti, así que considéralo una
          invitación formal. Será un día largo, de los de comer sin prisa,
          bailar hasta que cierren y volver a casa sin voz.
        </p>
        <p>
          De momento solo te pedimos que apuntes el día. Lo demás — horarios,
          autobuses, preboda, pre-preboda — te lo iremos contando.
        </p>
        <p class="std-invite-sign">Nos vemos el 13 de Marzo.</p>
        <p class="std-invite-ps">Trece años y un día trece. No ha sido a propósito.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="std-actions-label">Guardad la fecha en vuestro calendario</p>
      <div class="std-actions">
        <a class="std-btn std-btn--primary" href={`${base}boda-ana-y-emi.ics`} download>
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 10h18"/>
          </svg>
          Apple, Outlook y otros
        </a>
        <a class="std-btn" href={gcal} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/>
            <path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 10h18"/>
          </svg>
          Google Calendar
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Countdown />

  <section class="std-stay">
    <div class="std-stay-inner">
      <h2 class="std-stay-title">Dónde alojarse</h2>
      <div class="std-stay-divider"><span>✦</span></div>
      <div class="std-stay-intro">
        <p>Aunque la boda es en Jerez, nuestra recomendación es dormir en El Puerto
        de Santa María: la preboda será algo sencillo, pero será por aquí. Y si
        el tiempo acompaña, hay playa a mano.</p>
        <p>Marzo es temporada baja, así que hay sitio de sobra y se nota en los
        precios. Estos son los hoteles que conocemos.</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="std-hotels">
        {hotels.map(h => (
          <li class="std-hotel">
            <div class="std-hotel-text">
              <p class="std-hotel-city">{h.city}</p>
              <h3 class="std-hotel-name">{h.name}</h3>
              <p class="std-hotel-note">{h.note}</p>
            </div>
            <a class="std-hotel-link" href={mapsUrl(h)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              Ver en el mapa
              <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <div class="std-rent">
        <h3 class="std-rent-title">Apartamentos y casas</h3>
        <p class="std-rent-text">
          Por Airbnb o Booking hay mucha oferta, y para una familia o un grupo
          suele salir mejor de precio. Cualquier zona de El Puerto está bien,
          pero estas son las que mejor conocemos:
        </p>
        <ul class="std-zones">
          {zones.map(z => <li>{z}</li>)}
        </ul>
        <p class="std-rent-note">
          Los autobuses saldrán del <strong>Kiosko de Rafa</strong>, en
          Fuentebravía, y de <strong>El Comercial</strong>. El centro también es perfecto para
          alojarse: si se queda mucha gente por allí, añadiremos una parada en
          la Plaza de Toros.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .std {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    grid-template-areas:
      "left head  right"
      "left body  right";
    align-items: center;
    align-content: center;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  /* ── Watercolour images ── */
  .std-img {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .std-img--left  { grid-area: left;  justify-content: flex-end; }
  .std-img--right { grid-area: right; justify-content: flex-end; padding-right: 2rem; }

  .std-img img {
    width: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 380px;
    object-fit: contain;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .std-img--right img {
    height: min(530px, 60vh);
    max-height: none;
    max-width: none;
  }

  /* ── Centre card ── */
  .std-head,
  .std-body {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    animation: stdFade 1.4s ease both;
  }

  .std-head { grid-area: head; padding: 2rem 2.5rem 0; }
  .std-body { grid-area: body; padding: 0 2.5rem 2rem; }

  .std-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.6vw, 1.7rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    /* la letra final arrastra el espaciado: se compensa para centrar */
    text-indent: 0.28em;
  }

  .std-ornament {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.4em;
  }

  .std-names {
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4.6vw, 5.2rem);
    font-weight: 200;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .std-names em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.20);
  }

  .std-name-pair {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .std-icon {
    width: 0.95em;
    height: 0.95em;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: middle;
    opacity: 0.15;
    margin-right: -0.05em;
  }

  .std-icon--flip {
    width: 1.1em;
    height: 1.1em;
    transform: scaleX(-1);
    margin-left: -0.25em;
    margin-right: 0;
  }

  .std-rule {
    width: 56px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
  }

  .std-date {
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 1.9rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .std-location {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.3vw, 1.6rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .std-location-venue {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
   color: inherit;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: color 0.25s, border-color 0.25s;
  }

  .std-location-venue:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-bottom-color: currentColor;
  }

  .std-location-city { padding-left: 1.2rem; }

  .std-time {
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.3vw, 1.6rem);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .std-invite {
    font-family: var(--font-invite);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--color-text);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
  }

  .std-invite p + p { margin-top: 0.9rem; }

  .std-invite-lead {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .std-invite-aside {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }

  .std-invite-sign {
    font-family: var(--font-script);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: 1.4rem !important;
  }

  .std-invite-ps {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-top: 0.4rem !important;
  }

  .std-actions-label {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* ── Actions ── */
  .std-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .std-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
  }

  .std-btn:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .std-btn--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .std-btn--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-dark);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  @keyframes stdFade {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }

  /* ── Mobile: stacked ── */
  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .std {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2.5rem 1rem;
    }

    .std-img {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-right: 0;
    }


    .std-img img,
    .std-img--right img {
      height: 140px;
      width: auto;
      max-height: none;
      max-width: 60vw;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .std-head { padding: 1.5rem 0.5rem 0.5rem; }
    .std-body { padding: 0.5rem 0.5rem 1.5rem; }

    .std-names {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: nowrap;
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.6rem);
      gap: 0.3em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .std-btn {
      flex: 1 1 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  /* ── Alojamiento ── */
  .std-stay {
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .std-stay-inner {
    max-width: var(--max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .std-stay-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .std-stay-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .std-stay-divider::before,
  .std-stay-divider::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 60px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .std-stay-divider span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .std-stay-intro {
    max-width: 34rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.8rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .std-stay-intro p + p { margin-top: 0.9rem; }

  .std-hotels {
    list-style: none;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .std-hotel {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.4rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .std-hotel:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }

  .std-hotel-text { min-width: 0; }

  .std-hotel-city {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .std-hotel-name {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .std-hotel-note {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .std-hotel-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    transition: color 0.25s, gap 0.25s;
  }

  .std-hotel-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-dark);
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .std-stay { padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem; }

    .std-hotel {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }
  }

  /* ── Apartamentos ── */
  .std-rent {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 3.2rem auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .std-rent-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .std-rent-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  .std-zones {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
  }

  .std-zones li {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.95rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .std-rent-note {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .std-rent-note strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
